        "evidence": "Re-read 2026-11-17. Lean hecke_satisfies_blitvic_hypothesis derives odd vanishing only from the assumed class HeckeBlitvicWickRecursion; the md asserts the decomposition unconditionally. The md claim is false: for one generator in H_2 under convention D, the third central moment is tr(s^3) - 3z tr(s^2) + 2z^3 = h^2 z + h - 2z - 3hz^2 + 2z^3, which at q = 2 (h = 3/2, z = 8/5) is -1.428, not 0. So the Wick class cannot be satisfied by the actual Markov-trace moments."
